; The Last Bridge's boss (.ai/endgame-castle.md 3.6): the keeper of his castle's gate, who holds it from
; the wall-walk and comes down into the yard only to a player who has reached the gate's foot. Narrower
; than the Warden of the Deep (a tall man, not a furnace), a little quicker on his feet, and harder to
; shove. The charge is BossEnemy's slam as a Line (SlamRadius its length, SlamTelegraphSeconds its
; wind-up); the sweep, the volleys and the gate's pour are the script's own exports. Health and the Arcane
; bonus are BossCatalog's [11] block.
